================================
ARCHITECTURE AUDIT REPORT
================================
Project: task-manager-api
Stack:   Python 3.14.3 + Flask 3.0.0 (Flask-SQLAlchemy 3.1.1 / SQLAlchemy 2.1.8)
Files:   15 analyzed | ~1158 lines of code

## Summary
CRITICAL: 8 | HIGH: 4 | MEDIUM: 7 | LOW: 5
